{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "rnd-object-storage-collection",
		"name": "RnD Object Storage API",
		"description": "Collection untuk API Object Storage menggunakan MinIO.\n\n## Cara Pakai\n1. Pastikan server sudah berjalan (`npm start`) di port 3000\n2. Pastikan MinIO dan PostgreSQL sudah aktif\n3. Untuk upload file, pilih tab Body > binary > Select File\n\n## Header Upload\n- `x-file-name`: Nama file yang diupload (wajib)\n- `x-service-mode`: Metode upload, pilih `stream` atau `buffer` (default: stream)\n- `Content-Type`: `application/octet-stream`\n\n## Perbedaan Mode\n- **stream**: Data mengalir langsung ke MinIO tanpa numpuk di RAM (hemat memori, cocok file besar)\n- **buffer**: Data dikumpulkan dulu di RAM baru dikirim ke MinIO sekaligus",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:3000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "fileId",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Upload File (Stream)",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "x-file-name",
						"value": "contoh-file.jpg",
						"description": "Nama file yang diupload (wajib)"
					},
					{
						"key": "x-service-mode",
						"value": "stream",
						"description": "Metode upload: stream (default) atau buffer"
					},
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/octet-stream",
						"description": "Menandakan body adalah data biner mentah"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "file",
					"file": {
						"src": ""
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files/upload",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files", "upload"]
				},
				"description": "Upload file menggunakan metode **Stream**.\n\nData file mengalir langsung dari client ke MinIO tanpa dikumpulkan di memori (RAM). Cocok untuk file berukuran besar karena hemat RAM.\n\n### Cara Pakai:\n1. Pilih tab **Body** > **binary**\n2. Klik **Select File** dan pilih file yang ingin diupload\n3. Klik **Send**"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "201 - Upload Sukses",
					"status": "Created",
					"code": 201,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"message\": \"File sukses diupload menggunakan metode STREAM!\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"originalName\": \"contoh-file.jpg\",\n    \"storagePath\": \"1752382800000-uuid-contoh-file.jpg\",\n    \"fileSize\": 5242880,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Upload File (Buffer)",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "x-file-name",
						"value": "contoh-file.jpg",
						"description": "Nama file yang diupload (wajib)"
					},
					{
						"key": "x-service-mode",
						"value": "buffer",
						"description": "Metode upload: stream (default) atau buffer"
					},
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/octet-stream",
						"description": "Menandakan body adalah data biner mentah"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "file",
					"file": {
						"src": ""
					}
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files/upload",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files", "upload"]
				},
				"description": "Upload file menggunakan metode **Buffer**.\n\nData file dikumpulkan seluruhnya di memori (RAM) terlebih dahulu, baru dikirim ke MinIO sekaligus. Lebih boros RAM dibanding stream.\n\n### Cara Pakai:\n1. Pilih tab **Body** > **binary**\n2. Klik **Select File** dan pilih file yang ingin diupload\n3. Klik **Send**"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "201 - Upload Sukses",
					"status": "Created",
					"code": 201,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"message\": \"File sukses diupload menggunakan metode BUFFER!\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"originalName\": \"contoh-file.jpg\",\n    \"storagePath\": \"1752382800000-uuid-contoh-file.jpg\",\n    \"fileSize\": 5242880,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Get All Files",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files"]
				},
				"description": "Mengambil daftar semua file yang tersimpan di database."
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "200 - Daftar File",
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n      \"originalName\": \"foto.jpg\",\n      \"storagePath\": \"1752382800000-uuid-foto.jpg\",\n      \"fileSize\": 5242880,\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Get File by ID",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files", "{{fileId}}"]
				},
				"description": "Mengambil detail satu file berdasarkan ID (UUID).\n\n### Cara Pakai:\nGanti `{{fileId}}` dengan UUID file yang ingin dicari, atau set variabel `fileId` di tab Variables."
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "200 - File Ditemukan",
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"originalName\": \"foto.jpg\",\n    \"storagePath\": \"1752382800000-uuid-foto.jpg\",\n    \"fileSize\": 5242880,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
				},
				{
					"name": "404 - File Tidak Ditemukan",
					"status": "Not Found",
					"code": 404,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"error\": \"File tidak ditemukan\"\n}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Update File Metadata",
			"request": {
				"method": "PUT",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n  \"originalName\": \"nama-baru.jpg\"\n}"
				},
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files", "{{fileId}}"]
				},
				"description": "Mengupdate metadata file (nama file) berdasarkan ID.\n\n### Body (JSON):\n- `originalName` (string, opsional): Nama file baru\n- `fileSize` (number, opsional): Ukuran file baru"
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "200 - Update Sukses",
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"message\": \"File berhasil diupdate\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"originalName\": \"nama-baru.jpg\",\n    \"storagePath\": \"1752382800000-uuid-foto.jpg\",\n    \"fileSize\": 5242880,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-13T03:15:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}"
				},
				{
					"name": "404 - File Tidak Ditemukan",
					"status": "Not Found",
					"code": 404,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"error\": \"File tidak ditemukan\"\n}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Delete File",
			"request": {
				"method": "DELETE",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}",
					"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
					"path": ["files", "{{fileId}}"]
				},
				"description": "Menghapus file dari MinIO dan database berdasarkan ID.\n\n⚠️ **Perhatian**: File akan dihapus permanen dari MinIO dan metadata-nya dihapus dari database."
			},
			"response": [
				{
					"name": "200 - Hapus Sukses",
					"status": "OK",
					"code": 200,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"message\": \"File berhasil dihapus\"\n}"
				},
				{
					"name": "404 - File Tidak Ditemukan",
					"status": "Not Found",
					"code": 404,
					"header": [
						{
							"key": "Content-Type",
							"value": "application/json"
						}
					],
					"body": "{\n  \"error\": \"File tidak ditemukan\"\n}"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
